  "description": "所有方法均兼顾了线程安全问题，如有问题欢迎及时反馈！感谢！\n      1、视觉相关控件库(支持缩放、拖动、绘制等），不依赖任何视觉库\n      2、获取上升沿、下降沿，以一定频率刷新等方法（节约CPU开支）\n      3、INI/XML读写方法\n      4、日志功能及报警信息管理机制\n      5、窗体自适应方法（只需要初始化构造一次即可自适应）\n      6、登录界面界面及密码管理\n      7、弃用YHCC_Track2Bar（后期不再维护），使用YHCC_TrackBar，主要变更事件方法，及自适应Bug\n      8、新增高速筛选API，相机数、吹气阀数可配置，基于C++开发的底层库，最大扫描时间可以达到ns级别，如需使用可邮件联系:eden_wang@outlook.com。\n      9、新增YHCC_ShareMemory，依赖自主“YHCC_Memory.dll”库文件实现共享内存以及C++与C#事件交互。\n      10、新增“YHCC_Measure_Tool”方法，支持H矩阵的平移、旋转、逆矩阵等基础操作，基础的测量等\n\n      1, visual related control library (support scaling, dragging, drawing, etc.), does not rely on any visual library\n      2, get rising edge, falling edge, refresh with a certain frequency (save CPU expenses)\n      3. INI/XML read and write methods\n      4. Log function and alarm information management mechanism\n      5, form adaptive method (only need to initialize the construction once can be adaptive)\n      6,Login interface Interface and password management\n      7,Deprecate YHCC_Track2Bar (no longer maintained later), use YHCC_TrackBar, major change event method, and adaptive bugs\n      8, new high-speed screening API, the number of cameras, the number of blow valve can be configured, based on C++ development of the bottom library, the maximum scanning time can reach ns level, if you need to use email contact :eden_wang@outlook.com.\n      9. Added YHCC_ShareMemory, which relies on the independent \"YHCC_Memory.dll\" library file to achieve shared memory and event interaction between C++ and C#.\n      10. Added the \"YHCC_Measure_Tool\" method, which supports basic operations such as translation, rotation, and inversion of the H matrix, as well as fundamental measurements",
